<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0">
<title>SPX Critical Thresholds</title>
<style>
:root{ --bg:#05111f; --fg:#c5c6c8; --card:#0b1828; --border:rgba(197,198,200,.15); --muted:#8b949e; --amber:#fbbf24; --green:#34d399; --red:#f87171; --purple:#cc79a7; --teal:#64d8cb; --orange:#e69f00; }
*{ box-sizing:border-box; }
body{ background:var(--bg); color:var(--fg); font-family:'Segoe UI',system-ui,sans-serif; font-size:14px; margin:0; padding:24px 30px; }
.header{ color:var(--muted); font-size:12px; padding-bottom:10px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); margin-bottom:14px; }
.at-glance{ font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#f0f0f0; background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:8px; padding:10px 14px; margin:12px 0 18px; }
.at-glance .muted{ color:var(--muted); font-weight:400; }
h2{ font-size:19px; margin:22px 0 10px; color:#f0f0f0; }
h3{ font-size:15px; margin:16px 0 8px; color:#d8d8d8; }
.chart{ margin:8px 0 16px; }
table{ border-collapse:collapse; width:100%; margin:8px 0 16px; font-size:13px; }
th,td{ border:1px solid var(--border); padding:7px 9px; text-align:left; }
th{ background:var(--card); color:#d8d8d8; font-weight:600; }
.grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:14px; }
.summary-card{ border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:8px; background:var(--card); padding:14px 16px; }
.summary-card .head{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; margin-bottom:6px; }
.summary-card .title{ font-weight:700; color:#f0f0f0; font-size:15px; }
.summary-card .tag{ color:var(--muted); font-size:11px; letter-spacing:1px; }
.pill{ font-size:11px; font-weight:700; padding:2px 9px; border-radius:999px; margin-left:auto; }
.pill.green{ background:rgba(52,211,153,.16); color:var(--green); }
.pill.red{ background:rgba(248,113,113,.16); color:var(--red); }
.pill.amber{ background:rgba(251,191,36,.16); color:var(--amber); }
.summary-card .narrative{ color:#d8d8d8; margin:6px 0 10px; font-size:13px; }
.summary-card table{ margin:0; font-size:12px; }
.summary-card td{ padding:4px 8px; border:0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); }
.summary-card tr:last-child td{ border-bottom:0; }
.summary-card td:first-child{ color:var(--muted); width:150px; }
.summary-card td:nth-child(2){ text-align:right; font-weight:600; }
.summary-card td:last-child{ color:var(--muted); text-align:right; width:130px; }
pre{ background:#0b1828; border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:6px; padding:12px; overflow-x:auto; font-size:12px; line-height:1.5; }
.footer{ color:var(--muted); font-size:11px; border-top:1px solid var(--border); margin-top:28px; padding-top:10px; }
ul{ margin:8px 0 16px; padding-left:20px; }
li{ margin-bottom:6px; }
/* ── v2 components ── */
.strip{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(150px,1fr)); gap:10px; margin:14px 0 18px; }
.strip .kv{ background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:8px; padding:8px 12px; }
.strip .kv .k{ color:var(--muted); font-size:11px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.6px; }
.strip .kv .v{ color:#f0f0f0; font-size:15px; font-weight:600; margin-top:2px; }
.band-row{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:14px; margin:8px 0 16px; }
.band{ border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:8px; padding:12px 14px; }
.band.green{ background:rgba(52,211,153,.07); border-color:rgba(52,211,153,.35); }
.band.red{ background:rgba(248,113,113,.07); border-color:rgba(248,113,113,.35); }
.band h3{ margin:0 0 6px; }
.band .big{ font-size:16px; font-weight:700; color:#f0f0f0; }
.chain{ display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:0; margin:10px 0 16px; align-items:stretch; }
.chain .node{ background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:8px; padding:8px 12px; min-width:150px; flex:1; }
.chain .node .n-label{ font-weight:700; color:#f0f0f0; font-size:13px; }
.chain .node .n-icon{ color:var(--sky,#56b4e9); font-size:11px; letter-spacing:1px; }
.chain .node p{ margin:4px 0 0; font-size:12px; color:var(--muted); }
.chain .arrow{ align-self:center; color:var(--muted); font-size:18px; padding:0 6px; }
.relation-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:14px; margin:8px 0 16px; }
.relation-card{ border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:8px; background:var(--card); padding:12px 14px; }
.relation-card .r-head{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; margin-bottom:4px; }
.relation-card .r-greek{ font-weight:700; color:#f0f0f0; font-size:14px; }
.relation-card .r-headline{ color:var(--green); font-size:12px; font-weight:600; }
.relation-card p{ margin:6px 0; font-size:13px; color:#d8d8d8; }
.relation-card .tr{ color:var(--muted); font-size:12.5px; border-top:1px dashed var(--border); padding-top:8px; margin-top:8px; }
.relation-card table{ margin:8px 0 0; font-size:12px; }
.relation-card td{ padding:3px 8px; border:0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); }
.relation-card tr:last-child td{ border-bottom:0; }
.tr-glossary dt{ font-weight:700; color:#f0f0f0; margin-top:10px; font-size:13px; }
.tr-glossary dd{ margin:2px 0 0; color:var(--muted); font-size:12.5px; }
.tr-block{ border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:8px; background:var(--card); padding:14px 18px; margin-top:26px; }
.tr-block h2{ margin-top:0; }
.tr-block .note{ color:var(--muted); font-size:12px; }
.pos-neg{ font-weight:700; }
.pos-neg.pos{ color:var(--green); }
.pos-neg.neg{ color:var(--red); }
/* ── boxing: consistent section container ── */
.box{ background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:10px; padding:16px 18px; margin:16px 0; }
.box h2{ margin:0 0 12px; }
.box > table{ margin:0 0 6px; }
.box > .box-note{ color:var(--muted); font-size:12px; margin-top:6px; }
/* ── collapsible (details) ── */
details.collapsible{ border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:10px; background:var(--card); margin:16px 0; }
details.collapsible > summary{ cursor:pointer; padding:14px 18px; font-size:16px; font-weight:700; color:#f0f0f0; list-style:none; user-select:none; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; }
details.collapsible > summary::before{ content:"▸"; color:var(--muted); transition:transform .15s ease; }
details.collapsible[open] > summary::before{ transform:rotate(90deg); }
details.collapsible > .box-inner{ padding:0 18px 16px; }
details.collapsible > .box-inner > table{ margin:0 0 6px; }
details.collapsible > .box-inner > .box-note{ color:var(--muted); font-size:12px; margin-top:6px; }
/* summary delta pill */
.delta{ font-size:12px; font-weight:600; margin-left:6px; }
.delta.pos{ color:var(--green); }
.delta.neg{ color:var(--red); }
.delta.flat{ color:var(--muted); }
/* ── At a Glance layered grid ── */
.ag-box{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px; }
.ag-label{ font-size:11px; letter-spacing:1px; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--muted); font-weight:700; }
.ag-label-vol{ opacity:.75; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; }
.ag-row{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(130px,1fr)); gap:8px; }
.ag-row-vol .kv{ opacity:.8; }
.ag-row-vol .kv .k{ font-size:10px; }
.ag-row-vol .kv .v{ font-size:13px; }
.ag-row-2{ grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(150px,1fr)); }
.ag-row-3{ grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr)); }
.ag-gex{ background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:8px; padding:8px 12px; }
.ag-gex .k{ color:var(--muted); font-size:10px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.6px; }
.ag-gex .v{ color:#f0f0f0; font-size:14px; font-weight:600; margin-top:2px; }
.ag-gex .v.pos{ color:var(--green); }
.ag-gex .v.neg{ color:var(--red); }
.ag-note{ color:var(--muted); font-size:11.5px; margin-top:4px; }
/* ── custom subtle scrollbar ── */
.overflow-x-auto{ overflow-x:auto; }.overflow-x-auto::-webkit-scrollbar{ height:6px; }
.overflow-x-auto::-webkit-scrollbar-track{ background:rgba(15,23,42,.6); border-radius:4px; }
.overflow-x-auto::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{ background:rgba(51,65,85,.8); border-radius:4px; }
.overflow-x-auto::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover{ background:rgba(71,85,105,1); }
/* ── unified 7-column grid ── */
.ag-header{ display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); padding-bottom:6px; gap:8px; }
.ag-grid7{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr); gap:6px; text-align:center; align-items:center; }
.ag-h{ font-size:10px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.5px; color:var(--muted); font-weight:700; }
.ag-h-vol{ color:var(--amber); opacity:.8; }
.ag-v-big{ font-size:16px; font-weight:700; color:#f0f0f0; }
.ag-v{ font-size:13px; font-weight:600; color:var(--fg); }
.ag-v-sm{ font-size:12px; color:var(--muted); }
.ag-v-vol{ font-size:12px; font-weight:500; color:var(--amber); opacity:.85; }
.ag-src{ font-size:9px; color:var(--muted); font-weight:400; }
.ag-src-vol{ font-size:9px; color:rgba(251,191,36,.6); font-weight:400; }
/* ── 4 metric cards ── */
.ag-cards4{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr); gap:10px; padding-top:6px; }
/* ── tooltip (pure CSS hover) ── */
.ag-tip{ position:relative; cursor:help; }
.ag-tip .tip-i{ font-size:10px; color:var(--muted); cursor:help; }
.ag-tip .ag-tip-box{ display:none; position:absolute; bottom:calc(100% + 6px); left:0; z-index:30; background:var(--card);
  border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:6px; padding:6px 9px; font-size:11px; color:var(--fg);
  width:220px; box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.5); text-transform:none; letter-spacing:0; font-weight:400; }
.ag-tip:hover .ag-tip-box{ display:block; }
.chip{ display:inline-block; font-size:11px; font-weight:800; padding:2px 10px; border-radius:999px; letter-spacing:1px; }
.chip-pos{ background:rgba(52,211,153,.16); color:var(--green); }
.chip-neg{ background:rgba(248,113,113,.16); color:var(--red); }
.flow-badge{ display:inline-block; font-size:10px; font-weight:800; padding:2px 9px; border-radius:999px; letter-spacing:.5px; }
.flow-green{ background:rgba(52,211,153,.18); color:var(--green); }
.flow-red{ background:rgba(248,113,113,.18); color:var(--red); }
.flow-flat{ background:rgba(148,163,184,.16); color:var(--muted); }
/* ── predictive scenario & directional engine ── */
.prediction-container{ margin:16px 0 18px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; }
.prediction-hero{ display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; gap:12px; background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:10px; padding:14px 18px; }
.bias-badge{ font-size:13px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:1px; padding:7px 14px; border-radius:999px; white-space:nowrap; }
.bias-badge.bullish{ background:rgba(52,211,153,.16); color:var(--green); border:1px solid rgba(52,211,153,.45); }
.bias-badge.bearish{ background:rgba(248,113,113,.16); color:var(--red); border:1px solid rgba(248,113,113,.45); }
.bias-badge.neutral{ background:rgba(251,191,36,.16); color:var(--amber); border:1px solid rgba(251,191,36,.45); }
.hero-metric{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:2px; }
.hero-metric span{ color:var(--muted); font-size:10px; letter-spacing:.8px; text-transform:uppercase; }
.hero-metric strong{ color:#f0f0f0; font-size:17px; font-weight:700; }
.hero-note{ color:var(--muted); font-size:11.5px; }
.scenario-table{ width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:13px; }
.scenario-table th{ background:var(--card); color:#d8d8d8; font-weight:600; }
.scenario-table th, .scenario-table td{ border:1px solid var(--border); padding:8px 10px; text-align:left; }
.scenario-table tr.row-bullish td:first-child{ border-left:3px solid var(--green); }
.scenario-table tr.row-neutral td:first-child{ border-left:3px solid var(--amber); }
.scenario-table tr.row-bearish td:first-child{ border-left:3px solid var(--red); }
.row-bullish td:first-child{ color:var(--green); font-weight:700; }
.row-neutral td:first-child{ color:var(--amber); font-weight:700; }
.row-bearish td:first-child{ color:var(--red); font-weight:700; }
.divergence-bar{ display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px 22px; background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:10px; padding:12px 16px; }
.status-item{ font-size:12.5px; color:#d8d8d8; }
.status-item strong{ color:#f0f0f0; }
.text-green{ color:var(--green); font-weight:600; }
.text-red{ color:var(--red); font-weight:600; }
.text-amber{ color:var(--amber); font-weight:600; }
@media (max-width:900px){ .grid,.relation-grid,.band-row{ grid-template-columns:1fr; } .chain{ flex-direction:column; } .chain .arrow{ transform:rotate(90deg); align-self:center; padding:4px 0; } }
@media print{
  body{ background:#fff; color:#111; }
  .header,.footer,.summary-card .tag,.summary-card td:first-child,.summary-card td:last-child{ color:#555; }
  h2,h3,.at-glance,.summary-card .title{ color:#111; }
  th,.summary-card,.at-glance,.strip .kv,.band,.relation-card,.chain .node,.tr-block{ background:#f2f2f2; color:#111; }
  th,td,.summary-card,pre,.at-glance,.strip .kv,.band,.relation-card,.chain .node,.tr-block{ border-color:#ccc; }
}
</style>
<script src="/static/vendor/plotly.min.js"></script>
</head>
<body>
<div class="header">{{ header.ticker }} &middot; Price {{ header.price_source }} &middot; Report date {{ header.report_date }} &middot; Sessions {{ header.sessions }} &middot; Data retrieved {{ header.retrieved_at }} from {{ header.source }}</div>
{{ provider_banner }}{{ quality_banner }}{{ help_block }}

{% if prediction and prediction.bias %}
<div class="prediction-container">
  <!-- Top Hero Status Bar -->
  <div class="prediction-hero">
    <div class="bias-badge {{ 'bullish' if prediction.bias.startswith('BULLISH') else 'bearish' if prediction.bias.startswith('BEARISH') else 'neutral' }}">EXPECTED DIRECTION: {{ prediction.bias }}{% if prediction.confidence is not none %} ({{ prediction.confidence }}% Conf){% endif %}</div>
    {% if prediction.active_pin is not none %}<div class="hero-metric"><span>Active Pin</span><strong>{{ prediction.active_pin | fmtnum }}{% if prediction.pin_flag == 'EXPIRING_PIN_FLIP' %}&nbsp;⚑{% endif %}</strong></div>{% endif %}
    {% if prediction.upside_trigger is not none %}<div class="hero-metric"><span>Accel Trigger</span><strong>&gt; {{ prediction.upside_trigger | fmtnum }}</strong></div>{% endif %}
    {% if prediction.downside_floor is not none %}<div class="hero-metric"><span>Bounce Floor</span><strong>{{ prediction.downside_floor | fmtnum }}</strong></div>{% endif %}
  </div>

  <!-- Scenario Matrix Table -->
  <div class="overflow-x-auto">
  <table class="scenario-table">
    <thead><tr><th>Scenario</th><th>Trigger Level</th><th>Dealer Hedging Action</th><th>Target Zone</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for s in prediction.scenarios %}
    <tr class="{{ s.class }}">
      <td>{{ s.name }}</td><td>{{ s.trigger }}</td><td>{{ s.hedging }}</td><td>{{ s.target }}</td>
    </tr>
    {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  </div>

  <!-- OI vs Volume Divergence Status -->
  {% if prediction.divergence %}
  <div class="divergence-bar">
    {% for d in prediction.divergence[:4] %}
    <span class="status-item">
      <strong>{{ d.strike | fmtnum }} {{ d.side }}:</strong>
      <span class="{{ 'text-amber' if d.flag == 'WALL_DECAYING' else 'text-red' }}">{{ 'DECAYING' if d.flag == 'WALL_DECAYING' else 'FORTIFYING' }} (OI: {{ d.gex_oi | fmt_signed_compact }} | Vol: {{ d.gex_vol | fmt_signed_compact }})</span>
    </span>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  {% if prediction.note %}<div class="hero-note">ⓘ {{ prediction.note }}</div>{% endif %}
</div>
{% endif %}

{% if iron_butterfly %}
<style>
  .ib-panel{ margin:16px 0 18px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:12px; }
  .ib-hero{ display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; gap:12px; background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:10px; padding:12px 16px; }
  .ib-signal{ padding:4px 10px; border-radius:999px; font-weight:700; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:.4px; }
  .ib-signal.ib-pin{ background:rgba(59,130,246,.15); color:#60a5fa; border:1px solid #2563eb55; }
  .ib-signal.ib-bearish{ background:rgba(248,113,113,.12); color:#f87171; border:1px solid #ef444455; }
  .ib-signal.ib-bullish{ background:rgba(52,211,153,.12); color:#34d399; border:1px solid #10b98155; }
  .ib-metric{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:2px; min-width:92px; }
  .ib-metric span{ font-size:11px; color:#8b949e; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.5px; }
  .ib-metric strong{ font-size:15px; color:#e6edf3; }
  .ib-metric strong.credit{ color:#34d399; }
  .ib-metric strong.risk{ color:#f87171; }
  .ib-note{ font-size:12px; color:#8b949e; line-height:1.5; }
  .ib-legs{ overflow-x:auto; }
  .ib-legs table{ width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:10px; font-size:13px; }
  .ib-legs th{ text-align:left; padding:8px 12px; color:#8b949e; font-size:11px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.5px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); }
  .ib-legs td{ padding:7px 12px; border-bottom:1px solid #1c2a3a; color:#e6edf3; }
  .ib-legs tr:last-child td{ border-bottom:none; }
  .ib-legs .sell{ color:#f87171; } .ib-legs .buy{ color:#34d399; }
</style>
<div class="ib-panel">
  <h2 style="margin:0">Iron Butterfly — Pin Harvest</h2>
  {% if historical.iron_butterfly %}
  <div class="note" style="color:var(--muted);font-size:12px">n/a (historical): The option chain was fetched in a later session than this day.</div>
  {% else -%}
  <div class="ib-hero">
    <span class="ib-signal ib-{{ 'pin' if iron_butterfly.signal.signal == 'PIN' else 'bearish' if iron_butterfly.signal.signal == 'BEARISH_BREAKOUT' else 'bullish' if iron_butterfly.signal.signal == 'BULLISH_ACCEL' else 'pin' }}">
      {{ iron_butterfly.signal.signal or 'N/A' }}
    </span>
    <div class="ib-metric"><span>Center (Pin)</span><strong>{{ iron_butterfly.center_strike | fmtnum }}</strong></div>
    <div class="ib-metric"><span>Wing Width</span><strong>{{ iron_butterfly.wing_width | fmtnum }}</strong></div>
    <div class="ib-metric"><span>Net Credit</span><strong class="credit">+{{ iron_butterfly.net_credit | fmtnum }}</strong></div>
    <div class="ib-metric"><span>Max Risk</span><strong class="risk">{{ iron_butterfly.max_risk | fmtnum }}</strong></div>
    <div class="ib-metric"><span>Return on Risk</span><strong>1 : {{ iron_butterfly.return_on_risk | fmtnum('{:,.2f}') }}</strong></div>
    <div class="ib-metric"><span>Net Theta /day</span><strong>{{ iron_butterfly.net_theta | fmtnum }}</strong></div>
    <div class="ib-metric"><span>Breakevens</span><strong>{{ iron_butterfly.lower_breakeven | fmtnum }} – {{ iron_butterfly.upper_breakeven | fmtnum }}</strong></div>
  </div>
  <div class="ib-note">
    Wing width from expected move ({{ iron_butterfly.width_source.em_points | fmtnum }} pts @ IV {{ iron_butterfly.width_source.iv_used | fmtnum('{:,.2f}') }}) on the {{ iron_butterfly.width_source.band }} grid.
    {{ iron_butterfly.signal.action }}{% if iron_butterfly.signal.target %} → target {{ iron_butterfly.signal.target | fmtnum }}{% endif %}.
  </div>
  <div class="ib-legs">
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>Action</th><th>Type</th><th>Strike</th><th>Mid</th><th>IV</th><th>Θ /day</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for leg in iron_butterfly.legs %}
        <tr>
          <td class="{{ 'sell' if leg.action == 'SELL' else 'buy' }}">{{ leg.action }}</td>
          <td>{{ leg.type }}</td>
          <td>{{ leg.strike | fmtnum }}</td>
          <td>{{ leg.mid | fmtnum('{:,.2f}') }}</td>
          <td>{{ leg.iv | fmtnum('{:,.1%}') }}</td>
          <td>{{ leg.theta | fmtnum('{:,.1f}') }}</td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  {%- endif %}
</div>
{% endif %}

<h2>At a Glance — Single Source of Truth</h2>
<div class="overflow-x-auto pb-2">
<div class="ag-box" style="min-width:900px">
  <!-- Header + flow badge -->
  <div class="ag-header">
    <span class="ag-label">At a Glance — Single Source of Truth</span>
    <span class="flow-badge {{ 'flow-' + (flow_signal.tone if flow_signal else 'flat') }}">{{ (flow_signal.label if flow_signal else 'Wall Holding') }}</span>
  </div>
  <!-- Unified 7-column grid: Row 1 OI + Row 1b Volume -->
  <div class="ag-grid7">
    <div class="ag-h">Spot</div><div class="ag-h">Call Wall</div><div class="ag-h">Put Wall</div>
    <div class="ag-h">HVL / Flip</div><div class="ag-h">Magnet</div><div class="ag-h">Charm Pin</div><div class="ag-h">Vanna Pin</div>
    <div class="ag-v-big">{{ header_strip.spot }}</div>
    <div class="ag-v">{{ header_strip.call_wall }} <span class="ag-src">(OI)</span></div>
    <div class="ag-v">{{ header_strip.put_support }} <span class="ag-src">(OI)</span></div>
    <div class="ag-v">{{ header_strip.gamma_flip }} <span class="ag-src">(OI)</span></div>
    <div class="ag-v">{{ header_strip.gamma_magnet }} <span class="ag-src">(OI)</span></div>
    <div class="ag-v-sm">{{ header_strip.charm }}</div>
    <div class="ag-v-sm">{{ header_strip.vanna }}</div>
    <div class="ag-h ag-h-vol">Intraday</div>
    <div class="ag-v-vol">{{ header_strip.call_wall_vol }} <span class="ag-src-vol">(VOL)</span></div>
    <div class="ag-v-vol">{{ header_strip.put_wall_vol }} <span class="ag-src-vol">(VOL)</span></div>
    <div class="ag-v-vol">{{ header_strip.gamma_flip_vol }} <span class="ag-src-vol">(VOL)</span></div>
    <div class="ag-v-vol">—</div><div class="ag-v-vol">—</div><div class="ag-v-vol">—</div>
  </div>
  <!-- Row 2: 4 metric cards with tooltips -->
  <div class="ag-cards4">
    <div class="ag-gex ag-tip"><div class="k">NET GEX (OI) <span class="tip-i">ⓘ</span><span class="ag-tip-box">Total Book = all-expiry OI-based net GEX (macro inventory).</span></div><div class="v {{ header_strip.net_gex_tone }}">{{ header_strip.net_gex }}</div></div>
    <div class="ag-gex"><div class="k">DAILY Δ (1D / 1W)</div><div class="v">{{ header_strip.net_gex_delta_1d }} / {{ header_strip.net_gex_delta_1w }}</div></div>
    <div class="ag-gex ag-tip"><div class="k">MATRIX (≤45 DTE) <span class="tip-i">ⓘ</span><span class="ag-tip-box">Matrix = DTE≤45 filter stripping far-dated LEAPS noise.</span></div><div class="v {{ header_strip.matrix_gex_tone }}">{{ header_strip.matrix_gex }}</div></div>
    <div class="ag-gex"><div class="k">SOURCE CHIP</div><div><span class="chip {{ 'chip-pos' if header_strip.source_chip == 'POSITIVE' else ('chip-neg' if header_strip.source_chip == 'NEGATIVE' else '') }}">{{ header_strip.source_chip }}</span></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="ag-note">Toplam kitap = all-expiry OI-based net GEX (macro depot). Matrix = DTE≤45 filter — active-trading gamma that strips far-dated/LEAPS noise; the gap comes from distant tenors.</div>
  <!-- Row 3: regime + VIX + positioning -->
  <div class="ag-row ag-row-3">
    <div class="ag-gex"><div class="k">Regime</div><div class="v">{{ header_strip.regime }}</div></div>
    <div class="ag-gex"><div class="k">VIX</div><div class="v">{{ header_strip.vix }}</div></div>
    <div class="ag-gex"><div class="k">Net DEX</div><div class="v">{{ header_strip.net_dex }}</div></div>
    <div class="ag-gex"><div class="k">Net Vanna</div><div class="v">{{ header_strip.net_vanna }}</div></div>
    <div class="ag-gex"><div class="k">Live Charm</div><div class="v">{{ header_strip.live_charm }}</div></div>
  </div>
</div>
</div>

<h2>Summary</h2>
<div class="overflow-x-auto pb-2">
<div class="grid" style="min-width:1100px">
{% for card in summary %}
<div class="box summary-card">
  <div class="head">
    <span class="title">{{ card.title }}</span><span class="tag">{{ card.tag }}</span>
    {% if card.get('delta') is not none %}<span class="delta {% if card['delta'] > 0 %}pos{% elif card['delta'] < 0 %}neg{% else %}flat{% endif %}" title="vs previous report">{% if card['delta'] > 0 %}+{% endif %}{{ card['delta'] }}</span>{% endif %}
    <span class="pill {{ card.signal.tone }}">{{ card.signal.label }}</span>
  </div>
  <div class="narrative">{{ card.narrative }}</div>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Metric</th><th>Current</th><th>1D Δ / 1W Δ</th><th>Context</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for label, value, note in card.rows %}<tr><td>{{ label }}</td><td>{{ value }}</td>
      <td>{% if card.get('delta_1d') is not none or card.get('delta_1w') is not none %}<span class="delta {% if (card.delta_1d or 0) > 0 or (card.delta_1w or 0) > 0 %}pos{% elif (card.delta_1d or 0) < 0 or (card.delta_1w or 0) < 0 %}neg{% else %}flat{% endif %}">{{ '%+.1f'|format(card.delta_1d) if card.delta_1d is not none else '—' }} / {{ '%+.1f'|format(card.delta_1w) if card.delta_1w is not none else '—' }}</span>{% else %}—{% endif %}</td><td>{{ note }}</td></tr>
    {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>
{% endfor %}
</div>
</div>

<details class="collapsible">
<summary>Gamma flip methods</summary>
<div class="box-inner">
<table>
  <thead><tr><th>Method</th><th>Flip</th><th>Spot is</th><th>Note</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
  {% for m in flip_methods %}
  <tr><td>{{ m.method }}</td><td>{{ m.value }}</td><td>{{ m.side }}</td><td>{{ m.note }}</td></tr>
  {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>
<div class="box-note">UW does not document how it computes its gamma flip, and the open-interest and volume flips can differ. The regime follows the open-interest flip; the other rows are cross-checks and do not vote. Put Wall uses the UW 181-365 day band.</div>
</div>
</details>

<details class="collapsible">
<summary>DTE Band Walls</summary>
<div class="box-inner">
<table>
  <thead><tr><th>DTE Band</th><th>Put Wall</th><th>Put Wall Net GEX</th><th>Call Wall</th><th>Call Wall Net GEX</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
  {% for w in dte_band_walls %}
  <tr><td>{{ w.band }}{% if w.band == '181-365' %} <b>(Put Wall standard)</b>{% endif %}</td>
    <td>{{ w.put_wall }}</td><td>{{ w.put_wall_net }}</td>
    <td>{{ w.call_wall }}</td><td>{{ w.call_wall_net }}</td></tr>
  {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>
<div class="box-note">Put Wall (main level) is taken from the 181-365 day band. The ALL row is the all-expiry max(+net) reference (UW gex-levels put_wall).</div>
</div>
</details>

<h2>SPX Option Position Map</h2>
<div class="box">{% if chart_html %}<div class="chart">{{ chart_html }}</div>
{% elif chart_image %}<div class="chart"><img src="{{ chart_image }}" alt="SPX Option Position Map"></div>{% endif %}</div>

<h2>Net GEX Tornado — Strike Profile</h2>
<div class="box">{% if tornado_html %}<div class="chart">{{ tornado_html }}</div>{% else %}<div class="box-note">Tornado data unavailable for this snapshot.</div>{% endif %}</div>

<h2>Liquidity Layer — Dealer Flow</h2>
<div class="box">
{% if envelope_html %}<div class="chart" style="margin:0 0 12px">{{ envelope_html }}</div>{% endif %}
<div class="band-row" style="margin:0">
  <div class="band green">
    <h3>Absorption Band <span style="font-weight:400;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px">(positive gamma — dealers trade against the move)</span></h3>
    <div class="big">{{ gex_envelope.absorption.range }}</div>
    <div>Net GEX {{ gex_envelope.absorption.net_gex }} &middot; ~{{ gex_envelope.absorption.per_25pt }}/25pt</div>
  </div>
  <div class="band red">
    <h3>Air Gap <span style="font-weight:400;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px">(negative gamma — dealers trade with the move)</span></h3>
    <div class="big">{{ gex_envelope.air_gap.range }}</div>
    <div>Net GEX {{ gex_envelope.air_gap.net_gex }} &middot; ~{{ gex_envelope.air_gap.per_25pt }}/25pt</div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="at-glance" style="margin:10px 0 0"><span class="muted">Zero crossing (approx. gamma flip):</span> {{ gex_envelope.zero_crossing }}</div>
</div>

<h2>Cross-Signal Synthesis</h2>
<div class="at-glance">
  <span class="muted">Stance:</span>
  <span class="pos-neg {{ 'pos' if signal_matrix.tone == 'green' else 'neg' if signal_matrix.tone == 'red' else '' }}">{{ signal_matrix.stance }}</span>
  <span class="muted"> &middot; {{ signal_matrix.summary }}</span>
</div>
<table>
  <thead><tr><th>Signal</th><th>Lean</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
  {% for r in signal_matrix.rows %}<tr><td>{{ r.title }}</td><td><span class="pill {{ r.tone }}">{{ r.label }}</span></td></tr>
  {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>

<h2>Greek Relations — How They Interact</h2>
<div class="chain">
  {% for s in chain %}
  <div class="node">
    <div class="n-icon">{{ s.icon }}</div>
    <div class="n-label">{{ s.label }}</div>
    <p>{{ s.english }}</p>
  </div>
  {% if not loop.last %}<div class="arrow">&rarr;</div>{% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
</div>
<div class="relation-grid">
  {% for r in relations %}
  <div class="relation-card">
    <div class="r-head"><span class="r-greek">{{ r.greek }}</span><span class="r-headline">{{ r.headline }}</span></div>
    <p>{{ r.english }}</p>
    {% if r.row %}<table><tbody>{% for label, value, note in r.row %}<tr><td>{{ label }}</td><td>{{ value }}</td><td>{{ note }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table>{% endif %}
    <div class="tr">{{ r.turkish }}</div>
  </div>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<h2>Volatility Board</h2>
<div class="at-glance" style="margin-top:0"><span class="muted">What it tells you —</span> whether implied vol is cheap or expensive, how the term structure slopes, and what the skew costs.</div>
{% if iv_rank or vrp or realized_vol or skew or vix %}
<table>
  <thead><tr><th>Metric</th><th>Value</th><th>Meaning</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
  {% if vix %}<tr><td>VIX family</td><td>
    {% if historical.vix %}n/a (historical){% else %}{% if vix.vix %}VIX {{ vix.vix|round(2) }}{% endif %}{% if vix.vix9d %} · 9D {{ vix.vix9d|round(2) }}{% endif %}{% if vix.vix3m %} · 3M {{ vix.vix3m|round(2) }}{% endif %}{% if vix.vix6m %} · 6M {{ vix.vix6m|round(2) }}{% endif %}{% if vix.vix1y %} · 1Y {{ vix.vix1y|round(2) }}{% endif %}{% if vix.vvix %} · VVIX {{ vix.vvix|round(2) }}{% endif %}{% endif %}
    </td><td>Term structure is <b>{{ "n/a" if historical.vix else (vix.term_mode or "n/a") }}</b>{% if vix.term_mode == 'contango' %} — short-dated calm, longer-dated more expensive (normal).{% elif vix.term_mode == 'backwardation' %} — near-term stress priced in (early warning).{% endif %}</td></tr>{% endif %}
  {% if iv_rank %}<tr><td>IV Rank (1Y)</td><td>{{ "n/a (historical)" if historical.iv_rank else (iv_rank.iv_rank_1y | fmtnum('{:,.1f}%')) }}</td><td>Where today's IV sits vs the past year; low = cheap options.</td></tr>{% endif %}
  {% if skew %}<tr><td>Skew (Put Bias)</td><td>{% if historical.skew %}n/a (historical){% else %}{{ skew.put_bias_1m | fmtnum('{:.1%}') }} (1M) · {{ skew.put_bias_3m | fmtnum('{:.1%}') }} (3M){% endif %}</td><td>Cost of downside protection vs upside bets. <span style="color:var(--amber)">Derived/unverified</span> ({{ skew.note }})</td></tr>{% endif %}
  {% if realized_vol %}<tr><td>Realized vs Implied</td><td>{% if historical.realized_vol %}n/a (historical){% else %}IV {{ realized_vol.implied_volatility | fmtnum('{:.1%}') }} · RV {{ realized_vol.realized_volatility | fmtnum('{:.1%}') }}{% endif %}</td><td>VRP posture: IV premium over realized = vol selling gets paid.</td></tr>{% endif %}
  {% if vrp %}<tr><td>Variance Risk Premium</td><td>{% if historical.vrp %}n/a (historical){% else %}{{ vrp.risk_premium | fmtnum('{:.2%}') }} (rank {{ vrp.rank | fmtnum('{:,.2f}') }}){% endif %}</td><td>Compensation for holding short vol; higher = richer sellers.</td></tr>{% endif %}
  </tbody>
</table>
{% else %}
<div class="note" style="color:var(--muted);font-size:12px">Volatility data unavailable for this snapshot.</div>
{% endif %}

<h3>Vol Term Structure</h3>
{% if vol_term and historical.vol_term %}
<div class="note" style="color:var(--muted);font-size:12px">n/a (historical): The term structure was fetched in a later session than this day.</div>
{% elif vol_term %}
<table>
  <thead><tr><th>Expiry</th><th>DTE</th><th>IV</th><th>Implied move</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
  {% for v in vol_term %}<tr><td>{{ v.expiry }}</td><td>{{ v.dte if v.dte is not none else "N/A" }}</td><td>{{ v.volatility }}</td><td>{{ v.implied_move_perc }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>
{% else %}
<div class="note" style="color:var(--muted);font-size:12px">Vol term structure unavailable.</div>
{% endif %}

<h2>Options Volume &amp; P/C</h2>
{% if options_volume and historical.options_volume %}
<div class="note" style="color:var(--muted);font-size:12px">n/a (historical): Options volume was fetched in a later session than this day.</div>
{% elif options_volume %}
<div class="at-glance" style="margin-top:0"><span class="muted">What it tells you —</span> whether options flow is protective (put-heavy) or directional, and how rich the premium is.</div>
<table>
  <thead><tr><th>Metric</th><th>Value</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>Put/Call Volume</td><td>{{ options_volume.pc_ratio|round(2) if options_volume.pc_ratio is not none else "N/A" }}</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Call Volume / Put Volume</td><td>{{ options_volume.call_volume }} / {{ options_volume.put_volume }}</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Net Call Premium</td><td>{{ options_volume.net_call_premium }}</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Net Put Premium</td><td>{{ options_volume.net_put_premium }}</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
{% else %}
<div class="note" style="color:var(--muted);font-size:12px">Options volume data unavailable.</div>
{% endif %}

<h2>Max Pain</h2>
{% if max_pain and historical.max_pain %}
<div class="note" style="color:var(--muted);font-size:12px">n/a (historical): Max pain was fetched in a later session than this day.</div>
{% elif max_pain %}
<div class="at-glance" style="margin-top:0"><span class="muted">What it tells you —</span> the strike where the most options expire worthless; a structural gravity center, NOT a directional signal.</div>
<table>
  <thead><tr><th>Expiry</th><th>Max Pain</th><th>% from Spot</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
  {% for m in max_pain %}<tr><td>{{ m.expiry }}</td><td>{{ m.max_pain }}</td><td>{{ m.distance_pct }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>
{% else %}
<div class="note" style="color:var(--muted);font-size:12px">Max pain data unavailable.</div>
{% endif %}

<h2>CFTC COT — E-mini S&amp;P 500 (TFF)</h2>
{% if cftc and historical.cftc %}
<div class="note" style="color:var(--muted);font-size:12px">n/a (historical): The CFTC report was fetched in a later session than this day.</div>
{% elif cftc %}
<div class="at-glance" style="margin-top:0"><span class="muted">What it tells you —</span> how big players (asset managers, leveraged funds, dealers) are positioned; weekly-delayed but regular.</div>
<div class="note" style="color:var(--muted);font-size:12px">Report date {{ cftc.report_date or "n/a" }} · Open interest {{ cftc.open_interest or "n/a" }}</div>
<table>
  <thead><tr><th>Group</th><th>Long</th><th>Short</th><th>Net</th><th>Weekly Δ</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
  {% for c in cftc.rows %}
  <tr><td>{{ c.group }}</td>
    <td>{{ c.long|fmtnum('{:,.0f}') }}</td>
    <td>{{ c.short|fmtnum('{:,.0f}') }}</td>
    <td class="pos-neg {{ 'pos' if (c.net or 0) >= 0 else 'neg' }}">{{ c.net|fmtnum('{:+,.0f}') }}</td>
    <td>{{ c.change|fmtnum('{:+,.0f}') }}</td></tr>
  {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>
{% else %}
<div class="note" style="color:var(--muted);font-size:12px">CFTC COT data unavailable.</div>
{% endif %}

<h2>Scenario Set</h2>
<table>
  <thead><tr><th>Scenario</th><th>Range</th><th>P</th><th>R:R</th><th>Expectancy E</th><th>Trade</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
  {% for s in scenarios.scenarios %}
  <tr>
    <td>{{ s.name }}</td><td>{{ s.range }}</td><td>{{ s.p }}</td>
    <td>{{ s.rr if s.rr is not none else "n/a" }}</td>
    <td>{{ s.expectancy if s.expectancy is not none else "n/a" }}</td>
    <td>{{ s.trade }}</td>
  </tr>
  {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>
<div class="note" style="color:var(--muted);font-size:12px">{{ scenarios.note }}</div>
{% if flow_signal %}
<div class="box" style="margin-top:14px">
  <div class="ag-label">Volume &amp; Flow Confluence Analysis</div>
  <div class="at-glance" style="margin:8px 0 0"><span class="flow-badge {{ 'flow-' + flow_signal.tone }}">{{ flow_signal.label }}</span> <span style="color:#d8d8d8">{{ flow_signal.narrative }}</span></div>
</div>
{% endif %}

<h2>Level Migration vs Prior Snapshot</h2>
<table>
  <thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>This Week</th><th>Previous</th><th>Δ</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
  {% for m in migration %}
  <tr><td>{{ m.level }}</td><td>{{ m.now | fmtnum }}</td>
    <td>{{ m.prev | fmtnum }}</td>
    <td>{{ m.delta | fmtnum('{:+,.1f}') }}</td></tr>
  {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>

<h2>Top-10 GEX Strikes</h2>
<table>
  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Strike</th><th>Net GEX</th><th>Gamma-Flip Side</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
  {% for t in top_gex %}
  <tr><td>{{ loop.index }}</td><td>{{ t.strike|round|int }}</td>
    <td class="pos-neg {{ 'pos' if t.net_gex >= 0 else 'neg' }}">{{ t.net_gex | fmtnum('{:+,.1f}') }}</td>
    <td>{{ t.side }}</td></tr>
  {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>

<h2>Expiry Distribution</h2>
<table>
  <thead><tr><th>Expiry</th><th>DTE</th><th>Band</th><th>Net GEX</th><th>Net DEX</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
  {% for e in summary_expiry %}
  <tr><td>{{ e.expiry }}</td><td>{{ e.dte }}</td><td>{{ e.band }}</td>
    <td>{{ e.net_gex }}</td><td>{{ e.net_dex }}</td></tr>
  {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>

<h2>Brier Scorecard</h2>
<div class="at-glance">
  <span class="muted">Scored weeks:</span> {{ brier.scored_count }}
  &middot; <span class="muted">Avg Brier:</span> {{ brier.average if brier.average is not none else "—" }}
  &middot; <span class="muted">Equal-weight ref:</span> {{ ("%.4f"|format(brier.equal_weight_reference)) if brier.equal_weight_reference is number else brier.equal_weight_reference }}
  {%- if brier.skill_score is number %}
  &middot; <span class="muted">Skill score:</span> {{ "%+.2f"|format(brier.skill_score) }}
  {%- endif %}
</div>
<div class="note" style="color:var(--muted);font-size:12px">{{ brier.verdict }}</div>

<h2>Details</h2>
<table>
  <thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Value</th><th>Reference Type</th><th>Method / Disclosure</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
  {% for row in details %}<tr><td>{{ row.level }}</td><td>{{ row.value }}</td><td>{{ row.ref }}</td><td>{{ row.method }}</td></tr>
  {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>

<h2>How to read this map (Gamma)</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Call Wall ({{ how_to_read.call_wall }}): magnetic ceiling — dealers may sell into rallies (take-profit zone).</li>
  <li>Put Wall ({{ how_to_read.put_wall }}): trampoline floor — dealers may buy into dips (bounce zone).</li>
</ul>
<p>Gamma Flip ({{ how_to_read.flip }}) — the volatility turning point:</p>
<pre>[ ABOVE FLIP LEVEL ]  ->  Positive Gamma Zone  ->  Volatility Suppressed (Calm)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[ GAMMA FLIP LEVEL ]  ->  The Volatility Turning Point
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[ BELOW FLIP LEVEL ]  ->  Negative Gamma Zone  ->  Volatility Accelerated (Wild)</pre>
<ul>
  <li>Crossing below the flip -> Danger zone: reduce position sizes, expect wider price swings, or buy protective puts.</li>
  <li>Crossing above the flip -> Safety zone: expect steady, grinding upward movement with low volatility.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Delta Map — Walkthrough</h2>
<ul>
{% for p in walkthrough %}<li>{{ p }}</li>{% endfor %}
</ul>

<div class="tr-block">
  <h2>Greek Sözlüğü &amp; İlişkiler — Türkçe</h2>
  <div class="note">Aşağıdaki tanımlar ve ilişkiler eğitim amaçlıdır; bu raporun İngilizce başlıklarıyla aynı veriden türetilmiştir. Teknik sözlük:</div>
  <dl class="tr-glossary">
    {% for g in glossary_tr %}<dt>{{ g.greek }}</dt><dd>{{ g.def }}</dd>{% endfor %}
  </dl>
  <div class="note" style="margin-top:14px">Bu haftaki veriye göre greek ilişkileri:</div>
  {% for r in relations %}
  <div style="margin-top:10px">
    <b style="color:#f0f0f0">{{ r.greek }}</b> — <span style="color:var(--muted)">{{ r.turkish }}</span>
  </div>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<div class="footer">{{ footer }}</div>
</body>
</html>
